{
    "title": "Heja Sports Team Communication",
    "description": "Heja is the simple and modern way to communicate within your sports team. It keeps everyone informed with a clear team schedule, important messages, automatic reminders and group text messaging including video and photo sharing.\r\n\r\nHeja help teams connect and grow together in a shared love for team sports. Trusted by over 235.000 teams, including coaches, parents, and players, worldwide.\r\n\r\nSCHEDULE YOUR SEASON\r\nSchedule games and practices with automatic reminders to parents and players. Heja helps you stay organized throughout the season.\r\n\r\nKNOW YOUR PLAYER'S AVAILABILITY\r\nStay updated on who's attending games and practices. Parents and players can also leave a comment with their attendance reply. Will you be late? Can't attend at all? Heja also reminds everyone to reply!\r\n\r\nCHALLENGE YOUR TEAM\r\nSet challenges for your team to complete by uploading a video or share a link explaining your team's task. Players reply with a video showing coaches and teammates what they've got!\r\n\r\nMESSAGING \r\nSend messages to individual team members, groups, or the entire team \u2014 it's up to you to decide. With read receipts, you're guaranteed to know who's seen your message and who hasn't.\r\n\r\nCUT THROUGH THE NOISE \r\nMake sure your message reaches everyone on time. Team posts in Heja are the first thing all members see, so it's never missed and give you an instant overview of how many that's seen your message or not.\r\n\r\nMANAGE MULTIPLE TEAMS \r\nCoach or play on several teams? Heja makes it simple for coaches, parents, or players to be part of more than one team \u2014 keeping all team info in one easy-to-find place!\r\n\r\nSHARE VIDEOS AND IMAGES\r\nThe safe and secure way to share photos of the team from practice or post strategies ahead of the game. Heja allows you to upload photos and videos directly from your pocket!\r\n\r\nCONTACT DETAILS IN ONE SAFE PLACE\r\nStore all the contact details for everyone on the team in one place with easy accessibility. Parents can arrange rides to practice and divide team responsibilities. Everything doesn't have to go through the coach!\r\n\r\nFREE TO USE\r\nThat's right. Heja is free for everyone on the team to use, with no limit to how many players and parents or guardians there are on the team.\r\n\r\nADVANCED FEATURES WITH HEJA PRO\r\nIs your team looking to advance to the next level? Unlock Pro to get attendance stats, manual attendance reminders, payment tracking, share documents, unlimited admin roles, and more! We're here for the long run and will advance together with your team! Heja Pro is available through in-app purchases.\r\n\r\nABOUT HEJA \r\nWe want to make it possible for every child in the world to experience the joys of team sports, from building friendships to bridging cultures and boosting health. That's what we believe in. Through Heja, we make it simple and accessible for everyone \u2014 including coaches, families, and players \u2014 to be part of a well-run sports team.\r\n\r\nPRIVACY\r\nMore than 235.000 teams trust Heja for their internal communications. We don't take that trust lightly and care a lot about your privacy. Read our privacy policy here: https://heja.io/privacy \r\n\r\nRead about Heja's terms of service here: https://heja.io/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Heja is the simple and modern way to communicate within your sports team. It keeps everyone informed with a clear team schedule, important messages, automatic reminders and group text messaging including video and photo sharing.<br><br>Heja help teams connect and grow together in a shared love for team sports. Trusted by over 235.000 teams, including coaches, parents, and players, worldwide.<br><br>SCHEDULE YOUR SEASON<br>Schedule games and practices with automatic reminders to parents and players. Heja helps you stay organized throughout the season.<br><br>KNOW YOUR PLAYER&#39;S AVAILABILITY<br>Stay updated on who&#39;s attending games and practices. Parents and players can also leave a comment with their attendance reply. Will you be late? Can&#39;t attend at all? Heja also reminds everyone to reply!<br><br>CHALLENGE YOUR TEAM<br>Set challenges for your team to complete by uploading a video or share a link explaining your team&#39;s task. Players reply with a video showing coaches and teammates what they&#39;ve got!<br><br>MESSAGING <br>Send messages to individual team members, groups, or the entire team \u2014 it&#39;s up to you to decide. With read receipts, you&#39;re guaranteed to know who&#39;s seen your message and who hasn&#39;t.<br><br>CUT THROUGH THE NOISE <br>Make sure your message reaches everyone on time. Team posts in Heja are the first thing all members see, so it&#39;s never missed and give you an instant overview of how many that&#39;s seen your message or not.<br><br>MANAGE MULTIPLE TEAMS <br>Coach or play on several teams? Heja makes it simple for coaches, parents, or players to be part of more than one team \u2014 keeping all team info in one easy-to-find place!<br><br>SHARE VIDEOS AND IMAGES<br>The safe and secure way to share photos of the team from practice or post strategies ahead of the game. Heja allows you to upload photos and videos directly from your pocket!<br><br>CONTACT DETAILS IN ONE SAFE PLACE<br>Store all the contact details for everyone on the team in one place with easy accessibility. Parents can arrange rides to practice and divide team responsibilities. Everything doesn&#39;t have to go through the coach!<br><br>FREE TO USE<br>That&#39;s right. Heja is free for everyone on the team to use, with no limit to how many players and parents or guardians there are on the team.<br><br>ADVANCED FEATURES WITH HEJA PRO<br>Is your team looking to advance to the next level? Unlock Pro to get attendance stats, manual attendance reminders, payment tracking, share documents, unlimited admin roles, and more! We&#39;re here for the long run and will advance together with your team! Heja Pro is available through in-app purchases.<br><br>ABOUT HEJA <br>We want to make it possible for every child in the world to experience the joys of team sports, from building friendships to bridging cultures and boosting health. That&#39;s what we believe in. Through Heja, we make it simple and accessible for everyone \u2014 including coaches, families, and players \u2014 to be part of a well-run sports team.<br><br>PRIVACY<br>More than 235.000 teams trust Heja for their internal communications. We don&#39;t take that trust lightly and care a lot about your privacy. Read our privacy policy here: https://heja.io/privacy <br><br>Read about Heja&#39;s terms of service here: https://heja.io/terms",
